Augmented Reality in Warehouse Operations: Opportunities and Barriers 
Author links open overlay panel Marie-Hélène Stoltz * , Vaggelis Giannikas * , Duncan McFarlane * , James Strachan ** , Jumyung Um * , Rengarajan Srinivasan * 
